          description: "<div>The R.A.I.N. mindfulness tool is a chilled superpower, a no-frills way to handle tough emotions, urges, or stress bombs without letting them take over—especially in recovery when cravings or old patterns try to creep back in.</div>\n<div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">It's like a mental reset button, drawn from mindfulness and created by Tara Brach. It turns \"I can't handle this feeling\" into \"I can be with this feeling until it passes.. \"</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Use it to pause, process, and move through the mess so you don't react on autopilot or slip up. Think of it as your inner coach helping you ride the wave instead of getting drowned by it.</p>\n</div>\n",
